{"id": "250348", "name": "משפט הגבול המרכזי – גבול הסתברות עבור Bin(n, 1/λ)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>יהיו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X_n\\sim\\mathsf{Bin}\\left(n,\\frac1{{{CT:0}}}\\right)\\)</span> סדרה של משתנים מקריים.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>חשבו את</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\displaystyle{\\lim_{n \\to \\infty}\\mathbb{P}\\left[ X_n &lt; {{CT:1}}n \\right]  = }\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> הסף קטן מהתוחלת בשיעור שגדל לינארית ב-n, בעוד שסטיית התקן גדלה רק כמו √n; אי-שוויון צ'בישב נותן שההסתברות שואפת ל-0.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — התוחלת, השונות והמרחק מהסף</b><br>עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X_n\\sim\\mathsf{Bin}\\left(n,p\\right)\\)</span> עם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(p=\\frac{1}{ {{CT:0}} }\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{E}[X_n]=np=\\frac{n}{ {{CT:0}} },\\qquad\\mathsf{Var}[X_n]=np(1-p)={{CT:2}}\\,n \\]</p>הסף קטן מהתוחלת ב-<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\frac{n}{ {{CT:0}} }-{{CT:2}}\\,n={{CT:3}}\\,n \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — אי-שוויון צ'בישב</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{P}\\left[X_n\\lt {{CT:2}}\\,n\\right]\\le\\mathbb{P}\\left[\\left|X_n-\\mathbb{E}[X_n]\\right|\\ge {{CT:3}}\\,n\\right]\\le\\frac{ {{CT:2}}\\,n}{\\left({{CT:3}}\\,n\\right)^2}=\\frac{ {{CT:4}} }{n}\\xrightarrow[n\\to\\infty]{}0 \\]</p>ולכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\mathbb{P}\\left[X_n\\lt {{CT:2}}\\,n\\right]=0 \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "checkbox", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": "LaTeXdisplaystyle"}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "mcq_correct(ta)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["la", "o1", "o2", "o3", "o4", "q", "ta", "tam"], "nvariants": 50}